        "original_id": "0e594daa-6704-52e2-b6ca-2cda9bd6a5c6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Townsend Coleman, Garth Jennings, Christophe Lourdelet, Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, Tori Kelly\n- Works: My Life as a Teenage Robot, The Replacements, Fantasia 2000, Sing, We're Dancin'\n- Roles: voice actor, host, director, writer, co-director, starring voice cast\n\nFacts:\n- Townsend Coleman was the host of the show We're Dancin'.\n- Townsend Coleman voiced Knotty in an unnamed 1992 work.\n- Townsend Coleman did additional voices in the film Fantasia 2000, released in 1999.\n- Townsend Coleman was associated with My Life as a Teenage Robot and The Replacements as a voice actor.\n- Sing is a 2016 American film directed and written by Garth Jennings.\n- Sing was co-directed by Christophe Lourdelet.\n- Sing stars the voices of Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, and Tori Kelly.\n- Townsend Coleman did additional voices in the film Sing, released in 2016.",
